# CODEOWNERS — OpenPlate v1
# Story 5.3 — pins the named-reviewer ownership on every path
# that touches user-facing copy.
#
# The named reviewer is documented in REVIEWERS.md at the repo
# root. Replace `@openplate-maintainer` with the actual GitHub
# handle when forking the repo.
#
# Format: <pattern>  <owner>
# Trailing `/` matches directories. `*` is a wildcard.

# ── Default owner (catches everything not explicitly pinned) ──
*  @openplate-maintainer

# ── Coach strings (every user-facing string lives here) ──
/packages/integrations/lib/src/l10n/coach_strings.dart  @openplate-maintainer

# ── All user-facing widgets ──
/apps/client/lib/widgets/  @openplate-maintainer

# ── All user-facing screens ──
/apps/client/lib/screens/  @openplate-maintainer

# ── All docs (user-facing + contributor-facing) ──
/docs/  @openplate-maintainer

# ── No-Dark-Patterns Standard + release checklist ──
/docs/no-dark-patterns-standard.md  @openplate-maintainer
/docs/release-checklist.md  @openplate-maintainer
/docs/v2-managed-oversight.md  @openplate-maintainer
/docs/adults-only.md  @openplate-maintainer

# ── Reviewers file ──
/REVIEWERS.md  @openplate-maintainer

# ── Verification scripts (the gate itself) ──
/tools/check_release_posture.dart  @openplate-maintainer
/tools/check_adults_only.dart  @openplate-maintainer
/tools/check_no_under_13_profiles.dart  @openplate-maintainer

# ── CI workflows that run the gate ──
/.github/workflows/release-gate.yml  @openplate-maintainer
/.github/workflows/ndp-review.yml  @openplate-maintainer
/.github/workflows/self-host-smoke.yml  @openplate-maintainer
